flowchart LR
  START[Request] --> C{Classify intent}
  C -->|order query| T1[Order Status]
  C -->|refund or return| T2[Returns and Refunds]
  C -->|anything else| T3[Fallback]
  T1 --> A1[GetOrderStatus]
  T1 --> A2[GroundedPolicyAnswer]
  T2 --> G{Gate:<br/>within cap?<br/>within window?<br/>owns order?}
  G -->|all pass| A3[ProcessRefund]
  G -->|any fail| A4[CreateEscalationCase]
  T3 --> A5[LogUnhandled]
  T3 --> A4
